flowchart TD
    X[State vector x = [E, N, vE, vN]^T] --> A[East displacement]
    X --> B[North displacement]
    X --> C[East velocity]
    X --> D[North velocity]

    A --> E[Local coordinate frame]
    B --> E
    C --> F[Speed heading input]
    D --> F

    F --> G[Predict step]
    E --> G
    G --> H[Covariance update]
    H --> I[GPS correction]
    I --> J[Next state estimate]
